{"seq":3,"slug":"dg-storage-quantity-licensing-cap","title":"存储量分级与许可上限管控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-warehouse-license-layout/dg-storage-quantity-licensing-cap","wordCount":3023,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"存储量分级与许可上限管控\">存储量分级与许可上限管控</h1><p>跨境电商的危险化学品经营许可证（仓储经营类）上，除了仓库地址和允许品种，还写着一个最容易被忽视却最先触发执法的字段：<strong>许可储存量</strong>。旺季把锂电池一次压三天库存、把香水从 3 万瓶加订到 8 万瓶，账面销量没事，但仓库里那个&quot;实际存在量&quot;可能已从四级重大危险源跳到二级，甚至超过许可证载明的储存能力。存储量分级的全部技术内容，就是把&quot;仓库里到底有多少危险化学品&quot;换算成可计算、可对账、可预警的数字，并让它始终待在几个不同来源的许可上限之内。</p>\n<p>内容边界：本篇只讲<strong>存储量的度量、分级与上限管控</strong>。资质审批链与消防/环评取得路径归 <a href=\"dg-warehouse-license-approval\">危仓资质、消防环评与审批取证</a>；UN 分类与可存放性判定归 <a href=\"../dg-classification-storable/\">危险品分类与可存放判定</a>；入库、盘点与温控归 <a href=\"../dg-inventory-operation/\">危险品库存作业</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-许可储存量-设计储量-实际存在量\">核心概念：许可储存量、设计储量、实际存在量</h2><p>管控失效几乎都源于把三个不同的&quot;量&quot;当成同一个数字。它们由不同主体确定、按不同口径计算、在不同文件里出现，只有分清才能对账。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>谁确定</th>\n<th>出现在哪里</th>\n<th>计算基准</th>\n<th>典型单位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>许可储存量</strong></td>\n<td>应急管理部门随许可证载明</td>\n<td>危险化学品经营许可证</td>\n<td>仓库储存设施可承载的<strong>最大危险化学品总量</strong></td>\n<td>吨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>设计储量</strong></td>\n<td>设计院 / 安全评价机构</td>\n<td>安全设施设计专篇、消防设计文件</td>\n<td>建筑防火分区与结构承载允许的储量</td>\n<td>吨 / 平方米堆荷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>实际存在量</strong></td>\n<td>仓库运营方实时维护</td>\n<td>库存台账、WMS、重大危险源监控</td>\n<td>某时点库内<strong>实际</strong>危险化学品数量</td>\n<td>吨（需换算）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者的关系是一条单向约束链：<strong>实际存在量 ≤ 许可储存量 ≤ 设计储量</strong>。设计储量是物理天花板，许可储存量是行政机关在天花板之下核定的运营额度，实际存在量是每天波动的经营结果。<strong>任何一刻实际量超过许可量，即构成超量储存</strong>；一旦达到 GB 18218 临界量，仓库在那一刻起就是重大危险源，无论许可证上有没有写这个身份。对账前必须先对齐口径：许可证按纯品净重计、WMS 按毛重件数计，两者对不平就无法管控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分级坐标-gb-18218-临界量与-s-q-判定\">分级坐标：GB 18218 临界量与 S/Q 判定</h2><p>危险化学品仓储的&quot;存储量分级&quot;，国家标准给出的坐标是 <strong>GB 18218《危险化学品重大危险源辨识》</strong>（现行 2018 版）。它按<strong>单元内危险化学品的实际存在量相对于临界量的比值</strong>判定，分两步。</p>\n<p><strong>第一步，单一品种</strong>：若单元内某一种危险化学品的实际存在量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 达到或超过其临界量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，该单元即构成重大危险源。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步，多品种</strong>：若单元内同时存在多种危险化学品，按下式加权判定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\frac{q_i}{Q_i} \\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 种品的实际存在量（吨），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为其临界量（吨），<strong>求和 ≥ 1 即判定成立</strong>。这条公式对电商仓的意义是：没有哪一种货&quot;单独够格&quot;，几种货加起来照样构成重大危险源——香水、指甲油、气雾剂、锂电池分散摆放，加起来过线一样要被辨识、备案、监控。</p>\n<p>GB 18218-2018 对常见品给出的临界量是<strong>吨量级</strong>，不是件数量级，这是电商团队最容易低估的地方。下表为量级参照，<strong>具体取值必须以现行标准原文为准</strong>（GB 18218 由应急管理部归口，见 <a href=\"https://www.mem.gov.cn/fw/flfgbz/fg/\">mem.gov.cn 法律法规栏</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>危险化学品</th>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>临界量量级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>氢</td>\n<td>易燃气体</td>\n<td>5 t</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氯</td>\n<td>毒性气体</td>\n<td>5 t</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氨</td>\n<td>毒性气体</td>\n<td>10 t</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>液化石油气</td>\n<td>易燃气体</td>\n<td>50 t</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>苯</td>\n<td>易燃液体</td>\n<td>50 t</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汽油</td>\n<td>易燃液体</td>\n<td>200 t</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乙醇 / 甲醇</td>\n<td>易燃液体</td>\n<td>500 t</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>第二步之上还有一级：重大危险源分级。</strong> 依据应急管理部《危险化学品重大危险源监督管理暂行规定》（原安监总局令第 40 号），重大危险源按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 值分级：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mfrac><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\alpha \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\beta_i \\frac{q_i}{Q_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为厂区外暴露人员校正系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 种品的校正系数。量级判据为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\geq 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 一级、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 \\leq R &lt; 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 二级、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10 \\leq R &lt; 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 三级、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &lt; 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 四级。等级越高，监控、备案与检查频次越严。<strong>电商仓的典型陷阱不是&quot;某一件货够格&quot;，而是&quot;旺季三天库存把 R 值抬高一个等级&quot;，而监控设施按淡季等级预埋。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"分级坐标之二-储存设施分类与-gb-15603-的容量约束\">分级坐标之二：储存设施分类与 GB 15603 的容量约束</h2><p>GB 18218 判&quot;够不够格叫重大危险源&quot;，**GB 15603《危险化学品仓库储存通则》**判&quot;这样存合不合规&quot;，两者共同限定了一个仓库能承载的量。GB 15603 确立的储存方式分三级，容量约束逐级收紧：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[同一仓库单元内的危险化学品] --&gt; B{禁忌物是否同库}&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; C[隔离储存&lt;br/&gt;保持规定间距]&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; D[隔开储存&lt;br/&gt;隔板或隔墙断开]&#10;  D --&gt; E{是否强禁忌配对}&#10;  E -- 是 --&gt; F[分离储存&lt;br/&gt;防火墙或独立建筑分隔]&#10;  C --&gt; G[逐分区扣除通道与禁忌物净容量]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[实际可用储量]\">graph TD\n  A[同一仓库单元内的危险化学品] --&gt; B{禁忌物是否同库}\n  B -- 否 --&gt; C[隔离储存&lt;br/&gt;保持规定间距]\n  B -- 是 --&gt; D[隔开储存&lt;br/&gt;隔板或隔墙断开]\n  D --&gt; E{是否强禁忌配对}\n  E -- 是 --&gt; F[分离储存&lt;br/&gt;防火墙或独立建筑分隔]\n  C --&gt; G[逐分区扣除通道与禁忌物净容量]\n  D --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[实际可用储量]</pre><p>其含义是：<strong>仓库的可用储量不是整库面积乘以堆荷，而是逐分区按&quot;隔离/隔开/分离&quot;扣减禁忌物与通道后的净容量</strong>。一个 3000 平方米的危险品库扣掉防火分区、禁忌物分离区、主通道、垛间距、墙顶灯距后，真正能堆货的面积往往不到一半；电商仓按&quot;托盘位&quot;估容量却不按净面积核算许可量，是超量储存的高频成因。堆垛与通道数值应以现行 GB 15603 及地方要求为准；GB 17914（易燃易爆）、GB 17915（腐蚀性）、GB 17916（毒害性）另按规定品类的堆高与温湿度。<strong>这些不是布局偏好，而是把许可储存量落到平面图上的物理依据。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"从吨到-sku-跨境电商常见品的量级换算\">从吨到 SKU：跨境电商常见品的量级换算</h2><p>许可证写吨、WMS 记件，中间必须有一个稳定的换算口径。核心规则是<strong>按危险化学品的净重（或以纯品折算的量）计</strong>，而不是商品毛重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>危险化学品</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>SKU</mtext></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtext>单件净含量</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>在库件数</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mtext>折算系数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{\\text{危险化学品}} = \\sum_{\\text{SKU}} \\left( \\text{单件净含量} \\times \\text{在库件数} \\right) \\times \\text{折算系数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">危险化学品</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3443em;vertical-align:-1.2943em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SKU</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单件净含量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在库件数</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">折算系数</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对电商三类主力危险品，量级感受差别极大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SKU 类型</th>\n<th>UN 编号 / 类别</th>\n<th>单件典型净含量</th>\n<th>折算到临界量的感受</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>锂电池</td>\n<td>UN3480 / UN3481，第 9 类</td>\n<td>电芯能量按 Wh 计</td>\n<td>散件难单独过线，<strong>集量后是主力</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气雾剂（发胶、喷雾）</td>\n<td>UN1950，第 2.1 类</td>\n<td>每罐 100–400 mL</td>\n<td>罐数巨大时推进剂总量可观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高酒精香水</td>\n<td>UN1266，第 3 类</td>\n<td>每瓶 30–100 mL，酒精 70–90%</td>\n<td>单瓶酒精仅数十克，<strong>数十万瓶即入吨量级</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条务实的换算纪律：<strong>把每次到货的&quot;危险化学品净重&quot;作为入库字段写进 WMS</strong>，而不是事后用毛重估算。锂电池按 Wh、气雾剂按推进剂净重、香水按酒精净重三套系数分别维护，在收货环节固化；否则旺季只会得到一堆无法与许可证对账的件数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"许可上限的管控机制-台账-库存对接与超量预警\">许可上限的管控机制：台账、库存对接与超量预警</h2><p>把实际存在量压在许可量以下，靠的不是自觉，而是一套可查、可算、可预警的机制，最小闭环有五环：<strong>到货预报</strong>（收货时按 SKU 采集危险品净重）→ <strong>入库过账</strong>（累加分区实际存在量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>）→ <strong>阈值比较</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q \\geq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span> 许可量时硬阻断拒收或转入受限暂存，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>≥</mo><mtext>预警线</mtext><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q \\geq 预警线 80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预警线</span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 时通知仓储与合规）→ <strong>日结重算</strong>（按 GB 18218 重算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum q_i/Q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 值）→ <strong>跨等级触发复评</strong>（身份变更时更新重大危险源备案）。</p>\n<p>机制要点有三。<strong>第一，阈值是分区的、不是整库的</strong>——许可量与设计储量都按防火分区核定，整库汇总会掩盖单区超量。<strong>第二，阻断要硬</strong>——到达许可线时系统应拒绝过账或强制转入受限暂存区，而非事后出软提醒。<strong>第三，Σqi/Qi 与 R 值要日结而非月度重算</strong>——重大危险源身份随库存波动，只有日结才能当天触发跨等级复评。台账至少覆盖 SKU、UN 编号、单件净重、在库数量、所在分区、对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、本区已用许可量百分比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超量的代价与海外辖区的量级门槛\">超量的代价与海外辖区的量级门槛</h2><p>超量储存的法律后果是<strong>处罚叠加身份变化</strong>，不是单一罚款：实际量超过许可储存量即违法违规（可责令整改、罚款乃至停业整顿）；跨过 GB 18218 临界量而未辨识备案，则同时构成&quot;未按规定对重大危险源辨识、备案&quot;，两项从重。更实际的风险是保险与供应链——一次超量导致的停产整顿，会让整季度履约与平台绩效崩塌。</p>\n<p>跨境业务迁到海外仓时，抽象结构不变（按量分级、设阈值、备案监控），但阈值来源不同：中国用 GB 18218 + 安监总局令第 40 号；欧盟用 <strong>Seveso III 指令 2012/18/EU</strong>，把易燃液体按闪点与沸点分 lower tier / upper tier 两档，阈值相差数倍（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2012/18/oj\">EUR-Lex</a>）；美国用 <strong>OSHA 29 CFR 1910.106</strong>、<strong>NFPA 30</strong> 与建筑规范的 H-occupancy（H-1 至 H-4），环境侧另受 <strong>EPA Risk Management Program</strong>（40 CFR 68，对无水氨等设 10,000 磅量级门槛，<a href=\"https://www.epa.gov/rmp\">epa.gov/rmp</a>）约束。<strong>迁移到任一辖区，动作都一样：替换临界量来源、重算 Σqi/Qi、把新阈值写进预警线。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"实施路径与常见卡点\">实施路径与常见卡点</h2><p>落地顺序建议四步，与上一节的机制一一对应：<strong>固定口径</strong>（收货环节采集危险品净重，建三套折算系数）→ <strong>定分区阈值</strong>（按防火分区把许可量拆到区级，设 80% 预警线与 100% 阻断线）→ <strong>接入库存系统</strong>（到货预报、过账、日结重算与硬阻断）→ <strong>对齐备案</strong>（把 Σqi/Qi 与 R 值的日结结果接到重大危险源监控与复评流程）。</p>\n<p>高频卡点几乎都可预测：<strong>口径错配</strong>（许可证按净重、WMS 按毛重）；<strong>分区不拆</strong>（阈值只设在整库，单区超量到年底才发现）；<strong>旺季突发</strong>（备货潮把 R 值抬高一级，监控设施按淡季预埋）；<strong>身份滞后</strong>（未做日结则跨等级当天无动作）。最优解始终是<strong>前置判断</strong>：在备货计划阶段算清每批货折算到临界量的份额，把&quot;这个 SKU 旺季最多能压多少库存&quot;写进采购策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>存储量管控第一道坎是<strong>口径</strong>：许可储存量（应急管理部门核定）、设计储量（设计院按防火分区定）、实际存在量（仓库实时维护），三者满足 <strong>实际 ≤ 许可 ≤ 设计</strong>。</li>\n<li>分级坐标是 <strong>GB 18218</strong>：单品种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q \\geq Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 或加权 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum q_i/Q_i \\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 即构成重大危险源；之上再按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\alpha \\sum \\beta_i q_i / Q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分为一至四级（安监总局令第 40 号）。</li>\n<li>容量还要过 <strong>GB 15603</strong>：按隔离/隔开/分离逐分区扣减禁忌物与通道，可用储量远小于名义面积。</li>\n<li>电商仓把吨换成 SKU 的关键是<strong>按危险化学品净重计入库字段</strong>：锂电池按 Wh、气雾剂按推进剂净重、香水按酒精净重分别折算。</li>\n<li>管控机制要求<strong>分区阈值 + 硬阻断 + 日结重算</strong>；超量的代价是处罚与身份变化叠加。</li>\n<li>海外仓（Seveso III、OSHA 1910.106/NFPA 30、EPA RMP）抽象结构相同——替换临界量来源、重算求和、更新预警线即可迁移。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"存储量分级与许可上限管控","id":"存储量分级与许可上限管控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：许可储存量、设计储量、实际存在量","id":"核心概念-许可储存量-设计储量-实际存在量"},{"level":2,"text":"分级坐标：GB 18218 临界量与 S/Q 判定","id":"分级坐标-gb-18218-临界量与-s-q-判定"},{"level":2,"text":"分级坐标之二：储存设施分类与 GB 15603 的容量约束","id":"分级坐标之二-储存设施分类与-gb-15603-的容量约束"},{"level":2,"text":"从吨到 SKU：跨境电商常见品的量级换算","id":"从吨到-sku-跨境电商常见品的量级换算"},{"level":2,"text":"许可上限的管控机制：台账、库存对接与超量预警","id":"许可上限的管控机制-台账-库存对接与超量预警"},{"level":2,"text":"超量的代价与海外辖区的量级门槛","id":"超量的代价与海外辖区的量级门槛"},{"level":2,"text":"实施路径与常见卡点","id":"实施路径与常见卡点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"库区隔离、隔离距离与兼容分区规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-warehouse-license-layout/dg-zone-segregation-isolation"},"next":{"title":"危品收货核验与专区上架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-inventory-operation/dg-inbound-inspection-putaway"}}